OL,5,G0100 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FWarrington to Preston: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo sets off on a trip
OL,8,     Fthrough Britain's industrial
OL,9,     Fheartlands in the footsteps of
OL,10,     FGeorge V, beginning by travelling
OL,11,     Ffrom Warrington to Preston.
OL,12,G0130 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FBirmingham to the Potteries: Armed
OL,14,     Fwith his Bradshaw's guide, Michael
OL,15,     FPortillo reaches Birmingham and
OL,16,     Flearns how a radical reformer
OL,17,     Fwould make his mark on the 'city
OL,18,     Fof a thousand trades'.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG9/14
