OL,5,G0200 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FNewry to Portadown: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo sets off on the first leg
OL,8,     Fof a journey across Northern
OL,9,     FIreland to Argyll and Bute,
OL,10,     Fbeginning by travelling from Newry
OL,11,     Fto Portadown.
OL,12,G0230 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FBelfast to Portrush: On a journey
OL,14,     Ffrom Belfast to Portrush, Michael
OL,15,     FPortillo investigates the work of
OL,16,     Fauthor and Narnia creator CS
OL,17,     FLewis, and visits the Royal
OL,18,     FPortrush Golf Club.
OL,23,VpppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG10/14
